# destination rectangle (UIF-740)
ok empty picture: nothing drawn
ok AutoSize False: bounds kept
ok plain: picture size at the top-left
ok plain: 20 x 10 pixels
ok Center: (W - w) div 2, (H - h) div 2
ok Stretch: the whole control
ok Stretch + Proportional, wide picture: w = W, h = MulDiv(ph, W, pw)
ok Stretch + Proportional + Center
ok tall picture: h = H, w = MulDiv(pw, H, ph), centred
ok tall picture at the left
ok Proportional, picture fits: not enlarged
ok Proportional, picture larger: shrunk to fit
ok larger picture, no Stretch: clipped to the control
ok picture removed: nothing drawn
# Transparent
ok opaque: both halves drawn
ok sets the graphic's Transparent
ok transparent: the bottom-left colour is left out
ok transparent: the other pixels drawn
ok a new graphic takes Transparent
ok Transparent False reaches the graphic
# AutoSize (UIF-255)
ok AutoSize True: the picture size
ok picture size change follows
ok empty picture: no change
ok dump mode: no change (UIF-263)
ok outside dump mode again: the picture size
# streaming
ok stored bounds win over AutoSize (UIF-260)
